FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: the-invoice.
OFF THE RECORD: sums are fixed-point decimals with exactly two figures
OFF THE RECORD: after the point. No IEEE float is ever consulted; the
OFF THE RECORD: Court computes to the penny, truncates toward zero,
OFF THE RECORD: and rounds in no one's favor.
HEREINAFTER, the-hourly-rate SHALL MEAN 19.99.

ARTICLE 1.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT hours IS 3.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT subtotal IS the-hourly-rate TIMES hours.
    PROCLAIM "Subtotal: " PLUS THE TRANSCRIPT OF subtotal.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT filing-fees IS 0.05.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT total IS subtotal PLUS filing-fees.
    PROCLAIM "Total, with fees: " PLUS THE TRANSCRIPT OF total.
    PROCLAIM "Split three ways: " PLUS THE TRANSCRIPT OF (total APPORTIONED AMONG 3).
    SHOULD 0.10 PLUS 0.20 EQUAL 0.30, PROCLAIM "0.10 plus 0.20 is exactly 0.30 in this jurisdiction.".
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.
